            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "dcmihandler.cpp",
                    "line": 1435,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vernon Mauery",
                        "email": "vernon.mauery@gmail.com",
                        "username": "vmauery"
                    },
                    "message": "make the first parameter ipmi::Context::ptr &ctx so you can pass it on to the various dbus utilities later in the function to use the yielding APIs instead of the blocking APIs. There are plenty of examples of this in the repo already."
                },
                {
                    "file": "dcmihandler.cpp",
                    "line": 1435,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nagavarapu Sai Pavan",
                        "email": "saipavann@ami.com",
                        "username": "saipavann27"
                    },
                    "message": "Done. Added ipmi::Context::ptr& ctx as the first parameter to both getThermalLimit and setThermalLimit so the context can be passed to the D-Bus utility functions."
                },
                {
                    "file": "dcmihandler.cpp",
                    "line": 1435,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nagavarapu Sai Pavan",
                        "email": "saipavann@ami.com",
                        "username": "saipavann27"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "dcmihandler.cpp",
                    "line": 1458,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vernon Mauery",
                        "email": "vernon.mauery@gmail.com",
                        "username": "vmauery"
                    },
                    "message": "use the yielding API here and below."
                },
                {
                    "file": "dcmihandler.cpp",
                    "line": 1458,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nagavarapu Sai Pavan",
                        "email": "saipavann@ami.com",
                        "username": "saipavann27"
                    },
                    "message": "Done. Replaced the blocking getDbusProperty(*dbus, ...) / setDbusProperty(*dbus, ...) calls with the yielding getDbusProperty(ctx, ...) / setDbusProperty(ctx, ...) APIs, and updated error handling from try/catch to boost::system::error_code accordingly."
                },
